  "notes": "Record 43 of the same stellar-core --check-lcm golden file as cap0073-sac-trust-creates-trustline, copied byte for byte from the previous recording (commit 09f7d11b5f1d, one day earlier). The two payloads decode to the same ledger and transaction and differ only in the header: StellarValue arm, previous ledger hash, tx set hash and ledger hash. Both verdicts were measured on 2026-11-17 (repro/README.md): at 764a4f5bcbff the ledger is ingested and the trustline balance row is written, but no TRUSTLINE state change is stored; at c152783c054c TRUSTLINE/ADD and BALANCE_AUTHORIZATION/SET are stored."
